ADDITIONAL RETRIEVAL COMPONENTS

The hybrid retrieval implementation also depends on:

    Qdrant Python client 1.19.1 (Apache License 2.0)
    https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant-client

    FastEmbed 0.8.0 (Apache License 2.0)
    https://github.com/qdrant/fastembed

    BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 embedding model (MIT License)
    https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

    Qdrant's FastEmbed ONNX artifact for BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
    artifact revision 52398278842ec682c6f32300af41344b1c0b0bb2
    https://huggingface.co/qdrant/bge-small-en-v1.5-onnx-q

    Xenova/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 reranker model (Apache License 2.0)
    artifact revision a09144355adeed5f58c8ed011d209bf8ee5a1fec
    https://huggingface.co/Xenova/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2

These dependencies and model files retain their respective authorship and
licenses. They are not bundled as source files in this repository; the Python
packages are installed by the package manager and model files are downloaded
to a project-local cache on first use.

SHARED USER INTERFACE

The optional local browser command uses the independently versioned shared UI
package at this pinned revision:

    ui-ultra-rag-mcp
    commit 3f90ee16c1a49cdc9d2e72244f7968adf0d246a5
    https://github.com/AhmedKishki/ui-ultra-rag-mcp

The research server owns its adapter and project safety policy. The shared
package owns only the browser workspace and loopback HTTP boundary; it does not
store or retrieve research data.

